          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Now Available:<br>\n </span><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">ThermaClear</span></span></span></p>\n",
